# Executive offsites now live in the /offsite/ folder of this repo and are served directly.
# The old proxy to offsite.kuma.partners has been removed on purpose.
# Do not add a rule redirecting /offsite to /offsite/: Netlify treats both as the same
# path, so such a rule redirects to itself and causes ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS.

# Standalone offsite configurator for outbound links. Netlify already serves
# configurator.html for /offsite/configurator; this 200 rewrite also covers the
# trailing-slash form (Netlify matches rules with or without the slash). It is a
# rewrite to a file, never a redirect, so it cannot loop.
/offsite/configurator   /offsite/configurator.html   200

# Offsite pages. The new design sits at the top level of the repo (offsite-v2.html with
# offsite-v2.css and offsite-v2.js, and offsite-partners-v2.html with offsite-partners-v2.css
# and offsite-partners-v2.js). Forced 200 rewrites show them at /offsite/ and
# /offsite/partners.html (internal, the address stays the same). The old files
# (new.html, offsite/index.html, offsite/partners.html) stay in the repo for now and are not served.
# The old draft address /offsite/new sends people to /offsite/ for good.
# To go back to the previous design: point the /offsite/ rules at /new.html and delete the two
# partners rules, so /offsite/partners.html serves its own file again.
/offsite/new                /offsite/                    301!
/offsite/new.html           /offsite/                    301!
/offsite/                   /offsite-v2.html             200!
/offsite/index.html         /offsite-v2.html             200!
/offsite/partners           /offsite-partners-v2.html    200!
/offsite/partners.html      /offsite-partners-v2.html    200!

# The Round lives at /round/ (moved 28 Oct 2026 from theround.kuma.partners, then from /the-round/
# on 30 Oct 2026). The old addresses and the convenience alias 301 to the new page. Deep paths under the old folders also land on /round/, because the old subpages no longer exist. Do not add a
# rule from /round to /round/: Netlify treats both as the same path, so it would redirect to itself.
/the-round     /round/          301!
/the-round/*   /round/          301!
/theround      /round/          301!
/theround/*    /round/          301!

# Partners page in the new design (go-live 30 Oct 2026). The file partners-v2.html (with partners-v2.css,
# index-v2.css, index-v2.js and kuma.css) is shown at /partners and /partners.html; the address stays the same.
# To go back: delete these two lines, the old partners.html is still in the repo and serves itself again.
/partners        /partners-v2.html    200!
/partners.html   /partners-v2.html    200!

# Main site in the new design (go-live 30 Oct 2026). Each public address shows its -v2 file (internal rewrite, the
# address does not change). The old files (index.html, friction-scan.html, alignment-sprint.html, privacy.html,
# legal.html, partners.html, KOS.html, leadership-friction-scan.html, coordination-tax.html, cofounder-alignment.html)
# stay in the repo for rollback only. To go back for one page, delete its two lines.
/                           /index-v2.html                       200!
/index.html                 /index-v2.html                       200!
/friction-scan              /friction-scan-v2.html               200!
/friction-scan.html         /friction-scan-v2.html               200!
/alignment-sprint           /alignment-sprint-v2.html            200!
/alignment-sprint.html      /alignment-sprint-v2.html            200!
/privacy                    /privacy-v2.html                     200!
/privacy.html               /privacy-v2.html                     200!
/legal                      /legal-v2.html                       200!
/legal.html                 /legal-v2.html                       200!
/KOS                        /KOS-v2.html                         200!
/KOS.html                   /KOS-v2.html                         200!
/kos                        /KOS-v2.html                         200!
/kos.html                   /KOS-v2.html                         200!
/leadership-friction-scan       /leadership-friction-scan-v2.html    200!
/leadership-friction-scan.html  /leadership-friction-scan-v2.html    200!
/coordination-tax           /coordination-tax-v2.html            200!
/coordination-tax.html      /coordination-tax-v2.html            200!
/cofounder-alignment        /cofounder-alignment-v2.html         200!
/cofounder-alignment.html   /cofounder-alignment-v2.html         200!

# The Spanish pages were removed on 30 Oct 2026. Old addresses go to the home page.
/es         /    301!
/es/*       /    301!

# The offsite insights are retired (30 Oct 2026). The index and the eight articles go to the offsite page for good.
# The old files stay in offsite/insights/ and can be deleted later.
/offsite/insights       /offsite/    301!
/offsite/insights/*     /offsite/    301!
